' Takes up selection_actions_part.script's save: the camper is still
' selected. His inventory again, the sweater put down, and a walk.
load
clickon 248              ' already selected: OnMenuInventory on him
wait 5
uiclick 132,211          ' the sweater down where he stands
wait 5
esc
wait 5
mapclick 260,250         ' and he walks off; the leader stays
wait 100
save
